</div><div class="mf-collapsible-content">
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwARg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Smith_chart_explanation.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwARk"><img resource="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Smith_chart_explanation.svg" src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Smith_chart_explanation.svg/500px-Smith_chart_explanation.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="2666" data-file-height="1798" data-file-type="drawing" height="337" width="500" class="mw-file-element" id="mwARo" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption id="mwARs">Most basic use of an impedance Smith chart. A wave travels down a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transmission_line" title="Transmission line" id="mwARw">transmission line</a> of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Characteristic_impedance" title="Characteristic impedance" id="mwAR0">characteristic impedance</a> <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt88" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;''Z''{{sub|0}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwAR4"><i>Z</i><sub>0</sub></span>, terminated at a load with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electrical_impedance" title="Electrical impedance" id="mwAR8">impedance</a> <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt89" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;''Z''{{sub|L}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASA"><i>Z</i><sub>L</sub></span> and normalised impedance <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt90" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;''z'' = ''Z''{{sub|L}}/''Z''{{sub|0}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASE"><i>z</i> = <i>Z</i><sub>L</sub>/<i>Z</i><sub>0</sub></span>. There is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_reflection" title="Signal reflection" id="mwASI">signal reflection</a> with coefficient <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt91" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Î“&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASM">Î“</span>. Each point on the Smith chart simultaneously represents both a value of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt92" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;mvar&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Mvar&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;z&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASQ">z</span> (bottom left), and the corresponding value of <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt93" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Î“&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASU">Î“</span> (bottom right), related by <span class="texhtml " about="#mwt94" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Math&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;''z'' = (1 + Î“)/(1 &amp;minus; Î“).&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}" id="mwASY"><i>z</i> = (1 + Î“)/(1 <span typeof="mw:Entity">âˆ’</span> Î“).</span></figcaption></figure>

<section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwASc" aria-labelledby="Actual_and_normalised_impedance_and_admittance"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Actual_and_normalised_impedance_and_admittance">Actual and normalised impedance and admittance</h3><span class="mw-editsection">
<a role="button" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Smith_chart&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Actual and normalised impedance and admittance" class="cdx-button cdx-button--size-large cdx-button--fake-button cdx-button--fake-button--enabled cdx-button--icon-only cdx-button--weight-quiet ">
