<section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwAZM" aria-labelledby="The_variation_of_complex_reflection_coefficient_with_position_along_the_line"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="The_variation_of_complex_reflection_coefficient_with_position_along_the_line">The variation of complex reflection coefficient with position along the line</h4><span class="mw-editsection">
