edance Smith chart, is sometimes called an <i id="mwAZs">SWR circle</i> (short for <i id="mwAZw">constant <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standing_wave_ratio" title="Standing wave ratio" id="mwAZ0">standing wave ratio</a></i>).</figcaption></figure>
