</span>

</div><div>
<p id="mwAhQ">The Smith chart is composed of two families of circles: circles of constant normalised resistance (constant lines of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt175" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;\\Re e[z]&quot;}}" id="mwAhU"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \Re e[z]}">
