<p id="mwAmk">manually will confirm this.</p>

<p id="mwAmo">Once a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transformation_(mathematics)" title="Transformation (mathematics)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAms">transformation</a> from impedance to admittance has been performed, the scaling changes to normalised admittance until a later transformation back to normalised impedance is performed.</p>

